# M-Lab API key for this node. Keep this file secret.
#
# Created as 0600 root:root by the package installer, which asks for the
# key; "dpkg-reconfigure mlab-node" asks again. Or set the value provided by
# M-Lab below by hand.
#
# Caveat: systemd-tmpfiles automatically resets permissions and ownership of
# this file at package install and, subsequently, at every boot, regardless of
# any changes you may have made on the live system.
API_KEY=
